        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Draiman, Kip Winger, Dan Donegan, Mike Wengren, Steve \"Fuzz\" Kmak\n- Organizations: Disturbed, Device, Winger\n- Roles: vocalists, guitarist, drummer, bassist, songwriter, musician, solo artist\n\nFacts:\n- Kip Winger was born on June 21, 1961.\n- David Draiman was born on March 13, 1973.\n- In 1996, Disturbed formed when Dan Donegan, Mike Wengren, and Steve \"Fuzz\" Kmak hired David Draiman as vocalist.\n- David Draiman is an American songwriter and the vocalist for Disturbed and Device.\n- Kip Winger is an American rock musician, a member of Winger, and a solo artist.",
